I finish my work.
I come out of the office.
The weather outside is changing.
There is no bright sunshine in the sky now.
Dark and thick clouds come.
The sun hides.
Suddenly, a cool wind blows.
I feel very good.
It was very hot during the day today.
But now the wind is cool.
I look up at the sky.
The dark clouds move fast.
Will it rain?
There was rain in the weather forecast in the morning.
That forecast was absolutely right.
It will definitely rain today.
I take a deep breath.
The air is very fresh.
I go towards my bus stop.
